  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "文學中的生活解讀",
    "sub_ename": "INTERPRETING LIFE IN LITERATURE",
    "describe_ch": "生活中的感動經由作者文字的編輯而得以流傳，文學不只是語言文字的藝術，更是作者智慧的凝聚。經由文學作品、文學家生平的介紹引導學生體會生活的種種挑戰與美好，並且培養學生書寫的能力，爬梳成長的軌跡與自我療癒，希望在文學陶冶下，建構學生生活的智慧，培養面向未來的信念與克服困難的勇氣。",
    "describe_eh": "Literature is not only the art of language, but also the condensation of the author’s wisdom. Through the introduction of literary works, and the lives of writers, students are guided to experience the challenges and beauties of life. In addition, cultivating students’ writing ability is also important so that students can heal themselves in writing. Through the course, we hope that students will be influenced by literature, construct wisdom for life, and cultivate future beliefs and courage to overcome difficulties.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
