  "gradeRuleDescribe": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 1.0,
    "cls_id": "GE01110",
    "sub_id": "GM828",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>請按時繳作業、報告。請勿抄襲別人的作業。</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": null,
    "course_pol": "1. **準時到達**：請確保不遲到，準時進入教室。\n2. **按時交作業**：請不要忘記提交作業，確保在截止日期前完成。\n3. **專心聆聽**：上課時請專注，避免分心。\n4. **積極參與**：鼓勵同學在討論中發言，分享自己的想法。\n5. **尊重他人**：尊重老師和同學，保持良好的課堂氛圍。\n\n希望大家能遵守這些規則，共同創造良好的學習環境！\n\nBe Punctual: Please ensure you arrive on time and enter the classroom promptly.\nSubmit Assignments on Time: Do not forget to submit your assignments; make sure to complete them before the deadline.\nPay Attention: Please focus during class and avoid distractions.\nParticipate Actively: Students are encouraged to speak up during discussions and share their thoughts.\nRespect Others: Show respect to the teacher and classmates to maintain a positive classroom atmosphere.\nI hope everyone can follow these rules to create a good learning environment together!",
    "course_pol_en": null,
    "course_rem": "親愛的同學們，這裡是一些溫馨的提醒：請大家務必準時到達教室，這樣我們可以開始課程而不浪費時間。記得在截止日期前提交作業，這對你的學習非常重要。上課時請保持專注，這樣你能更好地吸收知識。鼓勵大家在討論中發言，分享你們的見解，讓課堂更生動有趣。請尊重老師和同學，這樣我們可以共同創造一個和諧的學習環境。謝謝大家的配合，讓我們一起努力！",
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>我期望每位同學都能全心投入學習，積極參與課堂討論，這樣才能真正提升自己的能力。在學習過程中，誠實和原創性是非常重要的，抄襲不僅會影響自己的成績，也會損害學習的價值。因此，請大家在完成作業和報告時，保持誠信，展現自己的思考與努力。相信只要用心學習，大家都能取得優異的成績，並在知識的海洋中成長茁壯！</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>I hope every student can fully engage in learning and actively participate in class discussions, as this is essential for truly enhancing your abilities. Honesty and originality are very important in the learning process; plagiarism not only affects your grades but also undermines the value of education. Therefore, please maintain integrity when completing assignments and reports, showcasing your own thoughts and efforts. I believe that as long as you study diligently, everyone can achieve excellent results and grow in the ocean of knowledge!</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": null,
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
  },
